    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The grid operator, acting as a crisis manager, issued an alert and enforced a blackout to protect a 230-kilovolt line. This action, while framed as grid stabilization, laid bare the system's collapse, leaving a supply shortage of more than 950 megawatts across the energy sector entity's network. The power producers became the system's immediate casualties.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "who-0",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When the grid operator imposed emergency control in the Visayas, it was in response to chronic system neglect and the failure of a single corporate asset—Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2. Officials then conducted load reduction, a measure exposing how the burden of crisis management falls on ordinary consumers to protect critical infrastructure. The result was a massive power deficit, with over 950 megawatts left unavailable.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "how-2",
        "center_kind": "how",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A corporate infrastructure failure, a single point of collapse, triggered a cascade of consequences across the region. This technical malfunction, layered atop ongoing maintenance failures, pushed the system to its limit. The grid authority's subsequent alert declaration was less a proactive warning and more a reactive acknowledgment of a crisis long in the making.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "why-1",
          "how-1"
        ],
        "center": "why-0",
        "center_kind": "why",
